Original sources and finite bounded-input, overlap-drain and paired RLE/IMDCT
polarity changes are provided with this module. Tables remain unchanged.
The JDK-only ASF adapter follows the pinned WmaFileLoader/WmaTrackProvider
container parsing, with bounded inputs and explicit ownership/cancellation.
WMA Pro, WMA lossless, ASF descrambling and indexed seek are unsupported.
